{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_physicsProcess","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"delta","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is only called if physics processing is enabled, which is done automatically if this method is overridden, and can be toggled with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Node\/setPhysicsProcess(enable:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Processing happens in order of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Node\/processPhysicsPriority","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", lower priority values are called first. Nodes with the same priority are processed in tree order, or top to bottom as seen in the editor (also known as pre-order traversal)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Corresponds to the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Node\/notificationPhysicsProcess","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" notification in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Wrapper._notification(code:reverse)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is only called if the node is present in the scene tree (i.e. if it’s not an orphan)."}]}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"delta","t